                            <div class="cus-bullet">
                                <h3>TABLE OF CONTENT</h3>
                                <li><a href="#1">The Importance of Comprehending the Kinds of Digital Marketing.</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#2">Learning Digital Marketing: A Contemporary Business Requirement.</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#3">Digital Marketing 8 Types Explained.</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#4">Search engine optimization (SEO)</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#5">Search Engine Marketing (SEM) / Pay-Per-Click (PPC).</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#6">Social Media Marketing (SMM)</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#7">Content Marketing</a></li>
