                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <h</h4>Q.1 Which kinds of digital marketing are there?</h3>
                            <p>SEO, SEM, social media marketing, content marketing, email marketing, influencer marketing, affiliate marketing, and mobile marketing are the eight categories of digital marketing.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <h3>Q.2 What is the most effective type of digital marketing?</h3>
                            <p>The success will be determined by the objectives, yet among the <b>Types of Digital Marketing</b>, SEO and content marketing will have long-term worth.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <h3>Q.3 Is it possible that small firms employ digital marketing?</h3>
                            <p>Yes, the <b>8 Types of Digital Marketing</b> are affordable and can apply to both large and small businesses.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <h3>Q.4 Why is the online marketing better than the conventional marketing?</h3>
                            <p>The <b>digital marketing</b> has improved superior targeting, monitoring and ROI, as opposed to conventional marketing.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <h3>Q.5 How long does it take to have the results of the digital marketing?</h3>
                            <p>Paid ads are one of the fastest <b> types of Digital Marketing</b> and SEO and content marketing are slow, but effective in the long run.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <h3>Q.6 Do you need to utilize every one of the 8 types of digital marketing?</h3>
                            <p>Not necessarily. The selection of the appropriate mix of<b>Type of Digital Marketing</b> depends on the needs of your business.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <h3>Q.7 Can digitally based marketing be applicable to service based companies?</h3>
                            <p>Yes, service-based companies are highly advantaged to the use of SEO, social media, and content marketing out of the<b>8 Types of Digital Marketing.</b></p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <h3>Q.8 Is it possible to use digital marketing to build the brand?</h3>
                            <p>Absolutely. Prominence and credibility of a brand gets enhanced, through tactical application of the <b>8 Types of Digital marketing.</b></p>
                        </div>
